# Generated documentation artifacts — NOT tracked.
#
# The source of truth for the specifications is doc/src/*.md plus the diagram
# sources (doc/drawio/*.drawio, doc/tools/*.py) and the pandoc template
# (doc/template/QNSC_Technical_Document_Format.docx). The .docx specifications
# are produced from those by build_docs.py and must never be committed:
#   - binary, so they cannot be diffed or reviewed;
#   - they go stale the moment the .md changes but the .docx is not rebuilt,
#     which reintroduces exactly the source-vs-output drift this project avoids.
# Run `python3 build_docs.py` in doc/ to (re)generate them locally.

# Generated .docx specs (produced by build_docs.py from src/*.md)
/*.docx

# Build intermediate: the numbering-stripped reference doc build_docs.py derives
# from the template on each run.
template/QNSC_Reference_NoAutoNum.docx

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
